    {
      "id": "claim_0f7a129ec2654fb092ba01aaa91ade66",
      "statement": "scan(text) unions three sources and merges overlapping spans via union_spans: the Presidio AnalyzerEngine (spaCy en_core_web_sm NER restricted to PERSON, plus recognizers for CA SIN, credit card, crypto, IBAN, IP, MAC, medical license, CA/US phone, URL, US bank/ITIN/driver license/MBI/NPI/passport/SSN, score threshold 0.40), deterministic regex patterns from privacy_patterns.py, and a clinical_code_intervals carve-out that protects clinical codes from redaction; overlapping spans of different kinds collapse into one REDACTED_IDENTIFIER token.",
