    {
      "id": "claim_3e3701770e8a421f81711f0544c0bb35",
      "statement": "clinical_code_intervals protects clinical codes (RxCUI, NDC, DIN, ATC, LOINC, SNOMED, ICD(-10), CPT, CCI, HCPCS, device model) from redaction so dosing/code answers survive scrubbing even adjacent to an identifier match; tests assert these codes remain in clean text while adjacent healthcare-admin identifiers are redacted.",
