    {
      "id": "claim_da6a6b2da2aa4378ad76fca8058ec343",
      "statement": "scan() returns PrivacyScan(clean_text, kinds) where each redacted span becomes a [REDACTED_<KIND>] token (or [REDACTED_IDENTIFIER] for merged mixed-kind spans); inputs larger than 16 KiB (MAX_INPUT_BYTES) raise PrivacyScanError(\"PRIVACY_INPUT_TOO_LARGE\") with no bypass.",
