      "statement": "The tracing input-redaction mechanism (_redact_root_inputs / LANGSMITH_HIDE_INPUTS) only covers the root run's recorded inputs; it does not scrub the root run's outputs, so a traced turn's contexts (retrieved chunk text) and safety_outcome/usage telemetry are copied verbatim into the LangSmith trace.",
