    {
      "id": "claim_353685396826468cb6d1c57cbd4e94d6",
      "statement": "evaluate_generated_output (processors/direct_output_policy.py) gates the tool query-response arm's direct-answer text before it is ever shown, denying with privacy_error (over MAX_INPUT_BYTES or any scrub hit), unsafe_direct_content (injection_flags match), or clinical_direct_content (a NUMERIC_DOSE match, a clinical-unit token, a clinical action/target instruction pattern, or failing the social-only-output check); only a clean pass returns the scrubbed content with no denial reason.",
