      "statement": "scripts/redact_smoke_log.py is a separate, regex-only redaction layer protecting CI-published deploy smoke-test logs (not model/log/trace/state boundaries): it masks credential shapes (bearer/API-key headers, lsv2_/sbp_ keys, JWTs, named env-var tokens) and truncates over-long lines to status+length before an artifact is uploaded, invoked by deploy.yml for both tag deploys and rollbacks.",
