      "statement": "The complete set of data categories that must never reach a model provider, log, trace, or persisted state unredacted comprises personal names, contact details (email/phone/postal code/address), government and financial identifiers (SIN/SSN/ITIN/credit card/bank number/driver license/passport/MBI/NPI/medical license), network identifiers (IP/MAC/crypto address/URL), biographic dates, and healthcare/administrative record numbers; clinical codes and dosing information are deliberately exempt since they are the content the system answers with.",
